Subject: [PATCH] Reproduce Kobo's Qt 6.5.2 sqlite changes

Extracted from kobolabs/Kobo-Reader commit
7a762964e7fa71ad8e8df50dd1b6eee721a43217, packages-v5.
Base: official qtbase-everywhere-src-6.5.2.tar.xz.
Includes changes carried by Kobo; this is not an attribution of authorship.
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [Kobo firmware source compatibility]

